 "summary": "A single silicon fast switching diode in the two-terminal SOD-323 surface-mount package. It blocks 100 V repetitive reverse, carries 250 mA average forward current, dissipates 250 mW at 25 °C and recovers in 4 ns at most. It is offered for small-signal and very fast switching. The body is marked A6 and a line marks the cathode.",
