  {
   "topic": "Construction",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The SOD-323 body is moulded in a compound rated UL 94V-0; the part is RoHS-compliant and halogen-free. The terminals are solder plated and meet the MIL-STD-750 method 2026 solderability test."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Power derating",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "The full 250 mW holds up to 25 °C ambient and falls linearly to zero at 150 °C."
  }
